    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973490/extras/cdb915a0c25ac490485f6154df5cf8c9.poster.avif?t=1739415860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973490/extras/cdb915a0c25ac490485f6154df5cf8c9.webm?t=1739415860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973490/extras/cdb915a0c25ac490485f6154df5cf8c9.mp4?t=1739415860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Blast your way through the endless swarm of enemies and live for as long as possible in this fast-paced, top-down shooter. Upgrade your tank, collect power-ups, and activate abilities to help you survive on a variety of maps in various game modes.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MAPS &amp; GAME MODES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 20+ maps while surviving in 27 different game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 standard game modes:</strong> Endless, Waves, and Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>24 unlockable challenge modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game mode can be played on 5 difficulty levels suited for players of all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UPGRADES &amp; ENEMIES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your tank throughout each run to become stronger while fighting off the never-ending horde of randomly selected enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies become increasingly difficulty as you survive for longer and more enemy types will begin to appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CLASSES &amp; ABILITIES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select a class to suit your playstyle and equip a special ability to help you escape dangerous situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PROGRESSION &amp; CUSTOMIZATION:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up by gaining XP after each run to unlock new classes, abilities, maps, game modes, cosmetics, and other epic rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your tank by choosing your preferred color combination and select from 50 various skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through the skill trees to unlock skills that will permanently increase your strength and unlock new capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEADERBOARDS &amp; ACHIEVEMENTS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive for as long as possible and see how your high scores compare with other players on countless global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attempt to complete over 100 achievements for extra rewards. Will you complete them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973490/extras/2f6cb1b708b18e1407a677182a6c54ce.poster.avif?t=1739415860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973490/extras/2f6cb1b708b18e1407a677182a6c54ce.webm?t=1739415860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973490/extras/2f6cb1b708b18e1407a677182a6c54ce.mp4?t=1739415860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
