ragraph\">Select a class to suit your playstyle and equip a special ability to help you escape dangerous situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PROGRESSION &amp; CUSTOMIZATION:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up by gaining XP after each run to unlock new classes, abilities, maps, game modes, cosmetics, and other epic rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your tank by choosing your preferred color combination and select from 50 various skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through the skill trees to unlock skills that will permanently increase your strength and unlock new capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEADERBOARDS &amp; ACHIEVEMENTS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive for as long as possible and see how your high scores compare with other players on countless global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attempt to complete over 100 achievements for extra rewards. Will you complete them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973490/extras/2f6cb1b708b18e1407a677182a6c54ce.poster.avif?t=1739415860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973490/extras/2f6cb1b708b18e1407a677182a6c54ce.webm?t=1739415860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973490/extras/2f6cb1b708b18e1407a677182a6c54ce.mp4?t=1739415860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
